# Voice of Resurgence: "Whenever an opponent casts a spell during your turn and when this creature dies, create a green and
# white Elemental creature token with 'This token's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you
# control.'" Bot1's own Voice cast (turn 1) and Ornithopter cast with Voice out (turn 3), and Bot2's Ornithopter and Mox Ruby on Bot2's own turn (2) make nothing. On turn 3
# (Bot1's) Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Voice: the cast trigger resolves first and makes a token, which counts only Bot1's three
# creatures (Voice, Ornithopter and itself; Bot2's Ornithopter is not "you control"): 3/3. The Bolt then kills Voice (until the death trigger resolves the token is 2/2: the count fell), whose death trigger makes
# a second token: each of the two is 3/3 (Ornithopter and the two tokens), with Voice gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Voice of Resurgence
Ornithopter
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Voice of Resurgence.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Voice of Resurgence
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Voice of Resurgence
? Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Ornithopter
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Voice of Resurgence; Ornithopter
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Voice of Resurgence)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token.Toughness = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token.Colors = Green; White
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token.Power = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Ornithopter; Elemental Token; Elemental Token
Bot1.Graveyard = Voice of Resurgence
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token#1.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token#2.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Elemental Token#2.Toughness = 3
Stack.Count = 0
